---
/**
 * Canary component guarding Astro scoped-style delivery (issue #761).
 *
 * Renders no markup. Its only job is to contribute one distinctively named
 * scoped rule to the build so `scripts/assert-scoped-styles.mjs` can prove that
 * Astro `<style>` blocks still survive the site build pipeline. If a future
 * PostCSS/PurgeCSS/bundler change silently strips scoped CSS again, the build
 * fails loudly instead of shipping unstyled pages.
 *
 * Do not remove, rename, or add markup to this component without updating the
 * assertion script.
 */
---

<style>
  /* Canary rule: no element carries this class, so it has no visual effect. */
  .turbo-scoped-style-canary {
    outline: 0 solid transparent;
  }
</style>
